// MODULE: DESIGNED POWERPOINT (editable, template-based)
// POST /api/pptx/designed  { style, accent, lang, title, slides:[…] }
//      – editable deck: every slide uses a layout of the slide master, so
//        new slides added in PowerPoint follow the same design
// GET  /api/pptx/template.potx?style=pro|fun&accent=FFD100&lang=no
//      – the master + layouts alone (PowerPoint template)
// Layouts: Title · Event – 1…6 photos · Section header · Title and content ·
// Blank. Event layouts hold placeholders for title, date/place, tagline,
// credits and one picture placeholder per photo. Geometry is defined in the
// same 1920×1080 px space as the browser renderer (1 px = 6350 EMU).
// ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
